"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 1526494, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwpum.jpg"}, {"id": 1526497, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwpup.jpg"}, {"id": 1526493, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwpul.jpg"}, {"id": 1526495, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwpun.jpg"}, {"id": 1526496, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwpuo.jpg"}], "slug": "gamblers-table", "summary": "Gamblers Table is an idle automation game where you toss coins to earn money. Buy bigger and better coins, unlock upgrades and hire little helpers to automate the process and take care of all the busy flipping work for you. Simple. Satisfying.\n\nClick a coin to toss it. Every time it lands on Heads, you earn money.\n\nThe more coins you own, the more you can flip. Buy upgrades to make them flip faster and yield more money. Discover curious interactions and unexpected synergies between different coin types.\n\nHire little helpers to take care of all the manual labour for you. They don\u2019t complain, and they never question.\n\nLeave your fortune behind and rise to something greater. Start again with peculiar new talents you didn\u2019t have before.\n\nAdmire your riches, lean back, and watch your automated coin-flipping empire grow.", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gamblers-table", "videos": [{"id": 149381, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "bT6jJfFzDJg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bT6jJfFzDJg", "title": "Gamblers Table Prototype - Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bT6jJfFzDJg/hqdefault.jpg"}]}